 "sentences": [
  "Adjusting to a new work environment can be challenging, but we're a close-knit team and we're all here to support you.",
  "So, I want you to commit to taking at least seven days of vacation per year.",
  "It's important to step away, recharge, and come back refreshed.",
  "That's an admirable attitude, and we'll ensure you have plenty of opportunities to grow and contribute.",
  "But burning out isn't an option.",
  "Even if it's just a long weekend here and there, it makes a huge difference.",
  "And remember, we're a team, so if you ever need help or feel overwhelmed, don't hesitate to reach out.",
  "That's what mentors are for.",
  "Remember, it's important to take breaks when you're coding.",
  "I want you to set a timer and make sure you take a break every 80 minutes.",
  "It's an important skill to develop, especially when working on team projects."
 ],
